{"s":[[null,1,[["t",[[[["l","罐头瓶生产力","No Profession"]],[["f","Tiller.png",24]," ",["l","罐头瓶生产力 - 农耕人","Tiller"]],[["f","Artisan.png",24]," ",["l","罐头瓶生产力 - 工匠","Artisan"]]]]],["p",["This page lists the productivity of processing ",["l","水果","Fruits"],", ",["l","蔬菜","Vegetables"],", Mushrooms, and ",["l","采集#Foraged Items","foraged items"]," into ",["l","果酱和腌菜","Jellies and Pickles"]," and ",["l","鱼籽","Roe"]," into ",["l","腌鱼籽","Aged Roe"]," or ",["l","鱼籽酱","Caviar"]," in a ",["l","罐头瓶","Preserves Jar"],"."]],["p",["The products produced always sell for more than the raw input items (except in the case of gold or iridium ",["l","黑莓","Blackberries"]," after learning the ",["l","熊的知识","Bear's Knowledge"],", or iridium ",["l","大葱","Spring Onions"]," after learning ",["l","青葱技术","Spring Onion Mastery"],"), so using a Preserves Jar is almost always profitable. Jellies and Pickles are always regular quality, so the profit made from processing items is lowest when using iridium quality and highest when using regular quality items."]],["p",["This table does not take into account the effects of Tiller or Artisan ",["l","耕种#Farming Skill","professions"],", which reduce and increase the profit from a ",["l","罐头瓶","Preserves Jar"],", respectively. To view the profitability for those professions, use the links at the top of the page."]],["p",["Note that the processing time for a Preserves Jar is always 4000 minutes, with one exception: ",["l","鱼籽","Sturgeon Roe"]," produces ",["l","鱼籽酱","Caviar"]," in 6000 minutes rather than 4000."]],["p",["Productivity (g/minute) = ([Processed Sell Price] - [Input Item Sell Price]) / [Processing time]"]],["p",["Approximate g/day = Productivity (g/minute) * 1600 [1]"]],["p",["Note that you may click on a column header to sort the table by that column, then Shift+Click on a second column to perform a secondary sort."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Input Item"]},{"h":1,"v":["Type"]},{"h":1,"v":["Quality"]},{"h":1,"v":["Input Item Sell Price"]},{"h":1,"v":[